      "description": "Current Student, Faculty and Staff Resources | North Central College Skip to main content Eyebrow Menu Visit Apply Programs Athletics Resources for Students Parents School Counselors Media Faculty & Staff Prospective Employees Search × View full results < Back Main Menu Home Apply Visit Give Academics Academics Programs Undergraduate Graduate Colleges & Schools Honors Program Cardinal Directions Study Abroad Shimer Great Books School Resources Academic Affairs Center for Student Success Course Catalog Library First Generation Programs Admissions Admissions Applicant Information Prospective Students Admitted Students Former Students Admission Events First-Year & Transfer Events Fine Arts Auditions Virtual Tour Admission Counselors First-Year Admission Counselors Transfer Admission Counselors International Admission Counselors Graduate Admission Counselors Application Resources Pay Your Deposit Community College Partnerships First-Generation College Students Veterans Reserve Officers Training Corps (ROTC) Non-Degree Applicants Undocumented Applicants Student Experience Student Experience Student Life Explore Housing Commuter Life Campus Dining Student Engagement and Belonging Center for Social Impact Faith & Action Activities Clubs & Activities Athletics Recreation & Fitness Living in Naperville Visit Chicago Reserve Officers Training Corps (ROTC) Campus Resources Student Affairs Center for Career and Professional Development Wellness Student Disability Services Title IX International Student Services First-Generation Program Campus Safety Tuition & Aid Tuition and Aid Tuition and Aid Undergraduate Cost of Attendance Graduate Cost of Attendance Grants for Undergraduates Scholarship Opportunities The College The College About Us Leadership Trustees Strategic Plan Community Values Transparency Sustainability Institutional Advancement Corporate Engagement Utility Menu Calendar Athletics Fine Arts Faculty & Staff Newsroom Search Pay Your Deposit Have you been admitted and need to lock in your decision? Click the link below to pay your deposit now! Deposit Today We use cookies on this site to enhance your user experience. By selecting the Accept button, you agree to us doing so. Accept Current Student, Faculty and Staff Resources The Hub Merlin Canvas Resources for Faculty and Staff Join our Cardinal family and explore all our resources for faculty and staff. The Hub The Hub is a user-friendly friendly intranet and the go-to source for internal information. From what's happening on campus, to directories, to time-off request forms and everything in between, it's all happening on The Hub! Learn More Merlin On Merlin, you'll be able to find important information such as pay advices, policies and much more. Learn More Canvas Canvas is is a web-based software that allows institutions to manage digital learning, educators to create and present online learning materials and assess student learning, and students to engage in courses and receive feedback about skill development and learning achievement. Canvas is used by North Central faculty and students to keep track of their courses, post and complete online assignments, update students on assignments, and provide up-to-date syllabi as well as other class information. Learn More PeopleAdmin PeopleAdmin is where you will log your requests for time off, fill out tax documents, manage your compensation, complete documentation related to your hires and those you manage, and more with easy-to-use online forms. Learn More Coursedog Coursedog is an event calendar system that centralizes and simplifies academic and event scheduling. The system provides efficient classroom scheduling and room reservations and supports event management by integrating resources and services into the scheduling process, allowing for custom workflows and collaboration across departments. Learn more More Resources Outlook Email Learn More Box Learn More Prospective Faculty Learn More Staff Openings Learn More Work Here North Central College faculty and staff join a community of learners that welcomes your expertise and enables your professional growth. The College has maintained its commitment to academic excellence; a climate that emphasizes leadership, ethics, value and service; a curriculum that balances job-related knowledge with a liberal arts foundation; and a caring environment with small classes for over a century and a half. Learn More Apply Request Information Donate Admissions Academic Programs Online Store About The College Work Here Athletics Fine Arts Alumni Hire Our Students Rent Our Facilities Report Misconduct IBHE Complaint System North Central College 30 N. Brainard Street Naperville, IL 60540 Campus Directory Mission Statement Privacy Policy & Legal Notice © 2026 North Central College Back to top"
